# The five source files of this conversion, pinned.
#
# convert_nist.py reads them from sources/nist/ (git-ignored). The Validators
# workflow downloads them from the base below, checks them against this list
# with `sha256sum -c`, runs the converter and fails if the conversion in this
# folder comes out different. The bundle and the two coverage reports are
# therefore a reproducible record: a change of the kernel, of
# oscal_conv_lib.py or of the converter that would alter them is noticed.
#
# One line of the coverage report is not a value of these files: the count
# of citations of SP 800-53 in the other corpora is taken over the bundles
# the repository holds when the converter runs.
#
# The base is the publisher's repository at commit 9402f031, the commit the
# IFA conversion is pinned to as well.
#
# base: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/usnistgov/oscal-content/9402f031489092246f2c27391bad452b85604140/
# into: sources/nist
# path: nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json
# path: nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_LOW-baseline_profile.json
# path: nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_MODERATE-baseline_profile.json
# path: nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_HIGH-baseline_profile.json
# path: nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_PRIVACY-baseline_profile.json
#
01f37cf90ea99d92242c936cbfbdebcc338eef1f71454e2acac36cc56e9bc062  NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json
8fd206017c8d718b44bdef612c2ff321a9fd84d97a515c8ec33c4619accbef6e  NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_LOW-baseline_profile.json
9030dbf1f13169947eb97eb101b4bd2f00d3c151b100455a923ac75803f00ea1  NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_MODERATE-baseline_profile.json
60576970caef91b2cba56d46e5948b72e3b879434fc2a4840bc4179e5e75cfd7  NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_HIGH-baseline_profile.json
7e650c4397ad633eadeaf510baa523372849b1fa3e18207b6c6b70ed456224f9  NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_PRIVACY-baseline_profile.json
